{"title":"1207.5136 Causal Inference on Time Series using Structural Equation Models","markdown":{"headingText":"1207.5136 Causal Inference on Time Series using Structural Equation Models","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"- 作者/日期/来源：Jonas Peters, Dominik Janzing, Bernhard Schölkopf；2012-07-21；arXiv:1207.5136\n- **一句话定位**：把 iid 数据上的函数因果模型（结构方程模型）推广到时间序列，定义\"带独立噪声的时间序列模型\"（Time Series Models with Independent Noise, TiMINo），证明其因果摘要图的广泛可识别性，并给出一个在模型假设不满足时宁可回答\"我不知道\"也不给错答的实用算法 TiMINo causality。\n- **研究问题**：给定多元时间序列样本 (X_1,…,X_T)，恢复真实的因果摘要图（summary time graph）；现有方法——Granger 因果（G-causality）、ANLTSM（Chu & Glymour 2008）、TS-LiNGAM——都不能同时处理非线性瞬时效应、隐混杂，且模型假设被违反时会无警示地给出错误结论。\n- **模型与方法**：设最大滞后阶 p、平稳、噪声同方差。定义 1（TiMINo）：X_t^i = f_i((PA_i^p)_{t−p},…,(PA_i^1)_{t−1},(PA_i^0)_t, N_t^i)，噪声 {N_t^i} 联合独立、对每个 i 在 t 上同分布，全时间图无环。要求方程来自可识别函数模型类（identifiable functional model class, IFMOC，含因果最小性且二元情形可识别，如线性非高斯、ANM、后非线性）。算法 1（无反馈情形）：迭代地在候选集 S 中为每个 k 拟合 TiMINo 并用 HSIC（对残差与各序列做 ±p 阶时移）检验残差独立性，选出独立性最好的 k* 作为\"汇\"序列从 S 中移除并令其父集为其余变量，直至 |S|=1，再剪除多余父集；若任何 k 都无法达到残差独立则输出\"我不知道——模型拟合差\"。拟合器可选线性（ar）、可加（gam）或 GP 回归（gptk）。另有部分发现程序：当混入隐变量时剔除子集 S₀ 后对其余序列拟合，输出部分图。\n- **主要命题/定理**：定理 1（可识别性）：若 X_t 服从 TiMINo 且 (i) 方程来自 IFMOC，或 (ii) 每个序列都有时间结构（父集含自身滞后）、联合分布对全时间图忠实、摘要图无环，则全时间图（从而摘要图）可由联合分布恢复；两条件互不蕴含，且条件 (ii) 表明时间结构使线性高斯情形也变得可识别。实验（每组 100 个模拟数据集）：实验 1（隐混杂 Z_t，参数 a∈[0,0.95]）：G-causality 与 TS-LiNGAM 在所有 a 下均错判 X→Y，TiMINo 对所有 a 不作决定；实验 2（线性高斯含瞬时效应，长度 2000）：TiMINo-linear 83% 正确 / 7% 错 / 10% 弃权，线性 Granger 13% 正确，TS-LiNGAM 19% 正确；实验 3（非线性）：TiMINo-gam/GP 95%/94% 正确而非线性 Granger 0%（其实现仅成对分析）；实验 4（非可加交互 exp(−(X_{t−1}+X_{t−2})²)）：仅 TiMINo-GP 在长序列下可靠；实验 6（隐变量 X）：部分发现 82% 正确恢复部分图。真实数据：煤气炉（n=296）各法均对；Old Faithful 间歇泉（n=194）TiMINo 对而非线性 Granger 反向；温度数据（n=16382）TiMINo 因可能的混杂（供暖）弃权而 TS-LiNGAM 反向；鲍鱼年龄-直径（无时间结构）TiMINo 正确、TS-LiNGAM 反向；黄油/奶酪价格（n=522，隐混杂为牛奶价）TiMINo 弃权而对比方法错判 X→Y。\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：是 ANM/LiNGAM 类约束型函数因果模型从 iid 到时间序列的系统扩展，明确以\"模型检验 + 宁弃权不犯错\"对抗 Granger 类方法在瞬时效应与混杂下的脆弱性；其可识别性框架与算法是 Peters 后续专著性工作（如 *Elements of Causal Inference*）中时间序列章节的基础。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"1207.5136.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-title-abstract":"摘要","section-title-appendices":"附录","section-title-footnotes":"脚注